<% provide(:title, "Sprinting for Solutions 5K Run") %>

<h1>Date, Time, and Location</h1>

<p>The first annual "Sprinting for Solutions" 5K run will take place on June
19th. The race will start at 9:00 A.M. and will end at approximately 11:00 A.M.
The race begins at the Pink Ribbon Alliance building on 7 Beacon Street. From
there, participants will follow the signs and markers until they complete the
run. The end location for the run is also the Pink Ribbon Alliance building. A
map of the route can be found below:</p>

<center>
    <%= image_tag("5k_route.jpg", alt: "Route for the race", height: 400) %>
</center>

<h3>What To Bring</h3>

<p>Individuals participating in the "Sprinting for Solutions" 5K Run should
bring sunscreen, shoes they are comfortable running in, and weather-appropriate
clothing. Participants are encouraged to check the weather on the day of the run
so they can dress appropriately. If participants so desire, they can (and are
encouraged to) bring their own water bottle for the run. However, water stations
will be set up at various points along the run and will have cups provided for
them. Participants should also bring a snack if they think they will need one or
if they so desire.</p>

<h1>Race Day Schedule</h1>

<ul style="list-style-type:none;">
    <li>8:00  Check-in opens</li>
    <li>8:45  Get on start line</li>
    <li>9:00  Race begins</li>
    <li>11:00 Race ends</li>
    <li>11:15 Results posted</li>
    <li>11:30 Awards ceremony</li>
</ul>